0A-SCOPE      : HARD GATE — butuh --scope
0B RECON      : subfinder + httpx + URL probes -> urls.txt
0C EXPLOIT    : C1 force-full-execution | C2 variants | C3 biz-logic | C4 PoC repos
                | C5 PoC variants | C6 references | C6b poc-techniques
